        "en": "Neat aisles and well-maintained facility"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The Canarsie location receives steady praise for its tidy appearance and organized product displays. Customers frequently mention clean floors, clearly categorized shelves, and reliable in-stock availability for dog and cat staples. The uncluttered environment creates an easy and pleasant shopping routine for neighborhood pet owners."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
