      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed evaluations of price value"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While multiple shoppers praise competitive price points on staples and compare shelf rates favorably to nearby pet chains, others mention issues with reward point deductions and disputed online account charges. Customers generally value regular promotions but note occasional billing confusion."
      }
    }
